.TH XMAS 6.SH NAMExmas \- a Christmas card in characters.SH SYNOPSIS\fBxmas\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA tree is drawn and trimmed, lights blink along its strings, reindeer runacross the screen, and a greeting is spelled out; then it plays roundagain, until control-C.  The OS-9 port of Larry Bartz's\fBasciixmas\fR.\fRIt draws through TERMCAP..SH SEE ALSOcard